Push 0, "They call me Sonny."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 1, "I\'d like to tell you more about myself, but I can\'t."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 2, "I don\'t even know my real name."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 3, "It all started a year ago, on that dreadful ship..."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 4, "I\'ll never forget the ship."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 5, "I died there."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 6, "But somebody brought me back."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 7, "Wake up, Sonny! Let\'s hope you\'re not too far gone."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 8, "...Sonny?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 9, "Hey, would you look at that! Maybe there\'s hope for you yet."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 10, "Come on, let\'s move! We need to get off this ship!"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 11, "Who are you?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 12, "I\'m Louis. Just a friend. Can you walk?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 13, "Yeah."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 14, "You\'ll need a weapon. Grab something."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 15, "Uh...how about this pipe?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 16, "Sounds fine, take it! This way!"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 17, "Sonny... Take this."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 18, "Louis, I don\'t know what to do or where to go! I don\'t remember anything!"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 19, "Just take it, please..."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 20, "What is it?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 21, "It\'s a tape. Maybe it can help you."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 22, "Louis? I don\'t need this! I need to remember! I need to-"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 23, "We reached it just a couple of days after killing that Paladin..."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CUTSUB"
GetMember
Push 24, "I thought it would be the answer to everything."
