GetMember
Push 0, "Welcome Back!"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTEXT2"
GetMember
Push 0, "Sonny 2 is an RPG-Strategy game. Your objective is to defeat the enemies and reach the end of the Zone. To fight the next enemy, press the red spinning button. But before you do that, I suggest you assign your abilties first (You have 5 base Ability Points to spend). Press the \'Abilities\' button on the grey panel below. Good luck, fish."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTITLE2"
GetMember
Push 1, "About Leveling Up"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTEXT2"
GetMember
Push 1, "You leveled up in the previous battle! As a result, you were rewarded 1 Ability Point to develop your character with, and several Stat Points. You may access these using the \'Abilities\' button. If you are unhappy with the way you have distributed your points, you can press the \'Re-Spec\' button, and your points will be reset (at a cost)."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTITLE2"
GetMember
Push 2, "Items and Equipment"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTEXT2"
GetMember
Push 2, "You have found an item in the previous battle. Item drops are displayed to you in the Victory screen, but you will not have them in your Inventory unless you take them and put them there. You may press the \'Inventory\' button on the grey panel below to view and equip the items for you and your team members."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTITLE2"
GetMember
Push 3, "Team Leader"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTEXT2"
GetMember
Push 3, "You may have noticed that during battle, there are some colorful buttons on the bottom left panel. You may use these buttons to direct your team members. Whilst you cannot control them fully, you can at least tell them how you want them to act."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTITLE2"
GetMember
Push 4, "The Way Forward"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "NAVTEXT2"
GetMember
Push 4, "If you press the \'Map\' button, you can see all the Zones available in \'Sonny 2.\' Once you have completed all the battles in a Zone, it will allow you to go to other Zones that are connected to it. Zones that you cannot access will appear grey, and ones which you can access will appear blue."
