GetMember
Push "NAVTEXT2"
GetMember
Push 5, "It is also in Felicity\'s interest to see the mayor overthrown. You are now able to use her in your team setup. Press the inventory button to display the team members, and SHIFT+CLICK to activate or deactive them."
