GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "CLASSDESCRIPT"
GetMember
Push 2, "Strong and stable, the Hydraulic line derives its power from its mastery of water. You can use it to bolster your physical strength, or channel it against the enemy to bring about their icy doom. Wielding such powers allows you greater control over the battle, as well as powerful survival and team support options."
