Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "BATTLESPEECH"
GetMember
Push 39, "Dígannos cómo encontrar esa Utopia. Entonces los ayudaremos."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "BATTLESPEECH"
GetMember
