SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "BATTLESPEECH"
GetMember
Push 41, "¡Un día más en la oficina!"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "BATTLESPEECH"
GetMember
Push 42, "¿Saben algo de la prisión?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
