GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "BATTLESPEECH"
GetMember
Push 48, "¿Vienen a unirse a nuestras filas? ¡Entonces demuéstrenlo!"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "BATTLESPEECH"
GetMember
