Push "GOTIP", 0, "Array"
NewObject
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "GOTIP"
GetMember
Push 0, "Having problems winning a fight? Observe your enemies carefully and try to find a weakness. Being victorious in Sonny is about having a successful strategy, so you may need to re-evaluate your ability configuration and execution. If you want guides on how to beat a specific stage, I recommend you to check out the ArmorGames or KrinLabs forums for some help."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "ENDING", "Congratulations! You\'ve beaten the game. So what now? If you haven\'t already, I recommend you to try the game on \'Heroic\' difficulty, the way that it was designed to be played! Or perhaps pitch your own character against a friend\'s, using the \'PvP Arena\' option. Visit www.ArmorGames.com for more games (including the first chapter of Sonny) and check for updates, in case we add some new Zones for you to play in. Seeya next time!"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUAL", 0, "Array"
NewObject
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUALEX", 0, "Array"
NewObject
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUAL"
GetMember
Push 0, "How do I play?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUALEX"
GetMember
Push 0, "You can just start a new game right now! Make sure that you have the tutorial level enabled. All the basics will be explained within the first few fights. Just listen to the dialogue and read the text. But if you insist on reading... Sonny is a turn based fighting game. You choose what move your character makes in his turn by first selecting WHO you want to make a move on, and then you can choose WHAT you want to do to that target. For example, if you want to attack an enemy, you click on the enemy first, then you can choose to attack him. If you want to heal a team mate, select that character and you will be able to choose a move to use on him. You may only have 8 moves \'equipped\' in any fight, and you configure this from your Abilities menu. Some moves can be equipped more than once, so that you can use it more often."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUAL"
GetMember
Push 1, "What do the colors on the buffs and numbers mean?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUALEX"
GetMember
Push 1, "They just indicate the element that the ability is classified as: Physical, Cosmic, Fire, Ice, Lightning, Earth, Shadow, and Poison."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUAL"
GetMember
Push 2, "Team Control"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUALEX"
GetMember
Push 2, "During battle, you can cannot directly control the actions of your team mates, but you can tell them how to behave. You can also equip your team mates with items and weapons, by going into the inventory screen."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUAL"
GetMember
Push 3, "What does each stat do?"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUALEX"
GetMember
Push 3, "Strength and Instinct are just co-efficients for your abilities. Speed is also a co-efficient, but to only a few abilities. Speed also increases your critical strike chance and dodge/accuracy. Vitality increases your Health. Piercing increases critical strike chance, and Defense decreases damage taken."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUAL"
GetMember
Push 4, "Help! I am stuck on a level!"
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "MANUALEX"
GetMember
Push 4, "It\'s mainly about the Strategy and Abilities that you use. Observe the enemy carefully, and look into your entire Ability tree to find ways to beat them. If you need more help, then try visiting the Sonny forums on ArmorGames for guides and walkthroughs."
SetMember
Push "KrinLang"
GetVariable
Push "ENGLISH"
GetMember
Push "EXPLAINEXTRA", "Please select a topic."
